#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-Eclipse-CycloneDDS.rst:7
msgid "Eclipse Cyclone DDS"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-Eclipse-CycloneDDS.rst:9
msgid ""
"Eclipse Cyclone DDS is a very performant and robust open-source DDS "
"implementation. Cyclone DDS is developed completely in the open as an "
"Eclipse IoT project. See also: https://projects.eclipse.org/projects/iot."
"cyclonedds"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-Eclipse-CycloneDDS.rst:15
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "先備條件"

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-Eclipse-CycloneDDS.rst:17
msgid ""
"Have :doc:`rosdep installed <../../../../ROS-Framework/client-libraries/"
"Working-with-Client-Libraries/Rosdep>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-Eclipse-CycloneDDS.rst:20
msgid "Install packages"
msgstr "安裝軟體包"

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-Eclipse-CycloneDDS.rst:22
msgid "The easiest way is to install from ROS 2 apt repository."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-Eclipse-CycloneDDS.rst:24
msgid "$ sudo apt install ros-rolling-rmw-cyclonedds-cpp"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-Eclipse-CycloneDDS.rst:29
msgid "Build from source code"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-Eclipse-CycloneDDS.rst:31
msgid "Building from source code is also another way to install."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-Eclipse-CycloneDDS.rst:33
msgid ""
"First, clone Cyclone DDS and rmw_cyclonedds in the ROS 2 workspace source "
"directory. To determine the correct branches to checkout, you need to find "
"what versions are specified in your `ROS distribution's ros2.repos file "
"<https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ros2/ros2/refs/heads/rolling/ros2."
"repos>`_."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-Eclipse-CycloneDDS.rst:36
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can run the following code to fetch the correct branch/"
"tag needed for Cyclone DDS:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-Eclipse-CycloneDDS.rst:38
msgid ""
"$ CYCLONEDDS_BRANCH=$(curl -s https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ros2/ros2/"
"refs/heads/rolling/ros2.repos | grep -A 3 \"eclipse-cyclonedds/cyclonedds:\" "
"| grep \"version:\" | awk '{print $2}')"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-Eclipse-CycloneDDS.rst:42
msgid "And now, clone and checkout the code:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-Eclipse-CycloneDDS.rst:44
msgid ""
"$ cd ros2_ws/src\n"
"$ git clone https://github.com/ros2/rmw_cyclonedds ros2/rmw_cyclonedds -b "
"rolling\n"
"$ git clone https://github.com/eclipse-cyclonedds/cyclonedds eclipse-"
"cyclonedds/cyclonedds -b ${CYCLONEDDS_BRANCH}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-Eclipse-CycloneDDS.rst:50
msgid "Then, install necessary packages for Cyclone DDS."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-Eclipse-CycloneDDS.rst:52
msgid ""
"$ cd ..\n"
"$ rosdep install --from src -i"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-Eclipse-CycloneDDS.rst:57
msgid "Finally, run colcon build."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-Eclipse-CycloneDDS.rst:59
msgid "$ colcon build --symlink-install"
msgstr "$ colcon build --symlink-install"

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-Eclipse-CycloneDDS.rst:64
msgid "Switch to rmw_cyclonedds"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-Eclipse-CycloneDDS.rst:66
msgid ""
"Switch from other rmw to rmw_cyclonedds by specifying the environment "
"variable."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-Eclipse-CycloneDDS.rst:68
msgid "$ export RMW_IMPLEMENTATION=rmw_cyclonedds_cpp"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-Eclipse-CycloneDDS.rst:72
msgid ""
"See also: :doc:`Working with multiple RMW implementations <../Working-with-"
"multiple-RMW-implementations>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-Eclipse-CycloneDDS.rst:75
msgid "Run the talker and listener"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-Eclipse-CycloneDDS.rst:77
msgid "Now run ``talker`` and ``listener`` to test Cyclone DDS."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-Eclipse-CycloneDDS.rst:79
msgid ""
"$ source /opt/ros/rolling/setup.bash\n"
"$ ros2 run demo_nodes_cpp talker"
msgstr ""
"$ source /opt/ros/rolling/setup.bash\n"
"$ ros2 run demo_nodes_cpp talker"

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-Eclipse-CycloneDDS.rst:84
msgid ""
"$ source /opt/ros/rolling/setup.bash\n"
"$ ros2 run demo_nodes_cpp listener"
msgstr ""
"$ source /opt/ros/rolling/setup.bash\n"
"$ ros2 run demo_nodes_cpp listener"
